WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:05.023
Unit seventeen. Artificial Intelligence Ethics!

2
00:00:06.161 --> 00:00:12.248
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English, Level six!

3
00:00:12.298 --> 00:00:15.469
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:15.519 --> 00:00:20.141
Today we learn: Artificial Intelligence Ethics. Let's go!

5
00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.124
AI ethics. Say it with me. AI ethics!

6
00:00:29.671 --> 00:00:33.505
Bias. Say it with me. Bias!

7
00:00:36.983 --> 00:00:41.200
Transparency. Say it with me. Transparency!

8
00:00:44.697 --> 00:00:48.880
Accountability. Say it with me. Accountability!

9
00:00:52.438 --> 00:00:56.221
Automation. Say it with me. Automation!

10
00:00:59.653 --> 00:01:03.203
Privacy. Say it with me. Privacy!

11
00:01:06.782 --> 00:01:10.949
Regulation. Say it with me. Regulation!

12
00:01:14.367 --> 00:01:17.851
Trust. Say it with me. Trust!

13
00:01:21.396 --> 00:01:31.686
Grammar time! As + clause (cause and effect). Listen. As automation grows, ethical concerns increase.

14
00:01:31.736 --> 00:01:37.891
Your turn. Say it with me. As automation grows, ethical concerns increase.

15
00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:56.314
AI ethics examines issues like bias, transparency, and accountability in automated systems. As automation grows, protecting privacy and building public trust requires thoughtful regulation.

16
00:01:56.364 --> 00:01:57.949
I like this story!

17
00:01:58.985 --> 00:02:04.268
Look! What's the word?

18
00:02:04.318 --> 00:02:05.663
Transparency!

19
00:02:06.784 --> 00:02:12.039
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:12.089 --> 00:02:13.239
Regulation!

21
00:02:14.264 --> 00:02:22.881
Think and answer. What ethical concern about AI worries you most?

22
00:02:22.931 --> 00:02:24.101
Great answer!

23
00:02:25.336 --> 00:02:28.045
This unit's value is Ethical Awareness.

24
00:02:28.095 --> 00:02:30.987
I can show ethical awareness every day!

25
00:02:32.153 --> 00:02:36.559
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

26
